  "details": "# Issue:\n\nDouble Clicking on the Groups Tab button now brings you to the Search Tab for Groups. This is similar to how the Worlds and Social Tabs do it.\n\nThere is one difference though, the Worlds and Social Tabs both have Tooltips telling you about it. This is currently missing from the Groups Tab button.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:  \n\nThe tooltip for the Groups Tab button should inform the player about it's double clicking function.\n\n\"Groups. Double click to search groups\"\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nThe first two pictures show how the Worlds and Social Tabs do it and the last one shows it missing from the Groups Tab.",
